[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4449.229, "timestamp": "01:14:09", "text": "不，你没被什么东西打到。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4471.35, "timestamp": "01:14:31", "text": "哦，等等。你会把他们送到枪击现场。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4477.83, "timestamp": "01:14:37", "text": "我不再赘述。我就此打住。文字太多了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4480.229, "timestamp": "01:14:40", "text": "你好。小心。小心。不用担心。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4481.669, "timestamp": "01:14:41", "text": "再次感谢您的光临！"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4485.02, "timestamp": "01:14:45", "text": "推荐一款游戏。意义重大。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4492.06, "timestamp": "01:14:52", "text": "是的。哦，它是怎么发生的？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4494.99, "timestamp": "01:14:54", "text": "[音乐]"}]